{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23137","headline":"待漏入阁书事奉赠元九学士阁老 · 白居易","name":"待漏入阁书事奉赠元九学士阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衙排宣政仗，门啓紫宸关。\n彩笔停书命，花甎趂立班。\n稀星点银砾，残月堕金环。\n暗漏犹传水，明河渐下山。\n从东分地色，向北仰天颜。\n碧缕炉烟直，红垂佩尾闲。\n纶闱惭并入，翰苑忝先攀。\n笑我青袍故，饶君茜绶殷。\n诗仙归洞里，酒病滞人间。\n好去鸳鸾侣，冲天便不还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}